# One line-ending convention, enforced at the boundary: files are LF in the
# repository regardless of the OS that wrote them. 94 files had drifted to
# CRLF over two days of sessions on Windows; the churn of normalizing grows
# with every commit, so it was paid once, in a purely mechanical commit,
# immediately after the OVERLORD acceptance went green.
* text=auto eol=lf
